    "description": "Auth service: register, login (generic errors, 429 after 5 failures), JWT checks (HS256 only), staff setup (single-use). Uses {{base_url}} and {{password}} from the environment. Steps reading \"dev outbox\" only work against dev-server.js (npm run dev).",
